@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 07. Role Assignment & Privilege Management

|Admin|
start
:Select Target User;


:Modify Role Assignments;
note right
  Add/Remove roles like
  ACCOUNTANT or USER
  (Mapped to security.roles)
end note

|Security System|
:Validate Privilege Level;
note right
  **Security Check:**
  Prevents an Admin from assigning
  a role higher than their own
  (Privilege Escalation).
end note

if (Authorized?) then (Yes)
  :Update User Roles Table;

  :Write to Audit Log;
  note right
    Records who changed what
    (Mandatory for Compliance)
  end note

  :Invalidate Active User Sessions;
  note right: Forces permission refresh

else (No)
  :Deny Request;
  |Admin|
  :Display "Insufficient Privileges";
  stop
endif

|Target User|
:Receive Role Update Notification;
:Permissions Applied (Next Request);

stop
@enduml